0/extras/64a13e202914288518e2b747144275da.webp?t=1771517517\" width=95 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cBootstrap Island is the Most Realistic VR Game I've Ever Played. Bootstrap Island blew me away. I have played a lot of VR survival games but Bootstrap Island has the best VR survival mechanics I've ever seen.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/968f981b38842aec6fd63a6a4982ab4a.webp?t=1771517517\" width=204 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cPCVR has been neglected for many new releases in the VR scene and now we finally got a diamond in the rough. Welcome to BOOTSTRAP ISLAND!\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/ef7beef98deea4b150ae0b8ccc52bb3a.webp?t=1771517517\" width=102 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cThe Next Gen VR Survival Experience that makes you want to stay...Bootstrap Island is incredibly detailed and for the first time in actually 2 years I did not want to put my headset off.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/3ed104f14aa2d082047fc65c50967cf0.avif?t=1771517517\" width=800 height=87 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1942110/extras/16e993c1cf533f0f401ab767feba7d75.avif?t=1771517517\" width=800 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-funded by the European Union. Co-funded by European Union Creative Europe Media.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_pa